{
  "zh-hans": {
    "description": {
      "league_naafiri": {
        "skill": "【附加包】掷出匕首，造成<#ff9028ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>25%<>物理伤害并流血<#ffb900ff>5秒<>；狗群扑向命中的英雄。<#ffb900ff>4秒<>内下次普攻掷出第二把匕首，造成<#ff9028ff>35<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>55%<>，目标每损失1%生命多1%伤害，命中英雄回复<#7bd96bff>35<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#7bd96bff>30%<>生命。",
        "ult": "【附加包】<#ff9028ff>暴吼<>：<#ffb900ff>0.75秒<>不可选取，狗群翻倍、攻击力+20%、移速+20%；随后扑向敌方英雄，造成<#ff9028ff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>65%<>物理伤害、<#ef5350ff>减速<>并降低20%护甲。<#ffb900ff>7秒<>内每次参与击杀都可再扑一次，获得<#7bd96bff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#7bd96bff>40%<>护盾。"
      }
    }
  },
  "zh-hant": {
    "description": {
      "league_naafiri": {
        "skill": "【附加包】擲出匕首，造成<#ff9028ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>25%<>物理傷害並流血<#ffb900ff>5秒<>；犬群撲向命中的英雄。<#ffb900ff>4秒<>內下次普攻擲出第二把匕首，造成<#ff9028ff>35<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>55%<>，目標每損失1%生命多1%傷害，命中英雄回復<#7bd96bff>35<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#7bd96bff>30%<>生命。",
        "ult": "【附加包】<#ff9028ff>獵犬嚎殺<>：<#ffb900ff>0.75秒<>無法被選取，犬群加倍、攻擊力+20%、移速+20%；隨後撲向敵方英雄，造成<#ff9028ff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>65%<>物理傷害、<#ef5350ff>緩速<>並降低20%護甲。<#ffb900ff>7秒<>內每次參與擊殺都可再撲一次，獲得<#7bd96bff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#7bd96bff>40%<>護盾。"
      }
    }
  },
  "en": {
    "description": {
      "league_naafiri": {
        "skill": "[Add-on] Hurls a dagger for <#ff9028ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>25%<> physical damage and a bleed over <#ffb900ff>5s<>; her pack leaps on a champion hit. Within <#ffb900ff>4s<> her next attack hurls the second dagger for <#ff9028ff>35<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>55%<>, 1% more for every 1% of health the target has lost, healing her <#7bd96bff>35<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#7bd96bff>30%<> on a champion.",
        "ult": "[Add-on] <#ff9028ff>The Call of the Pack<>: untargetable for <#ffb900ff>0.75s<>, a pack twice as big, +20% attack and +20% move speed. Then she pounces on an enemy champion for <#ff9028ff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>65%<> physical damage, a <#ef5350ff>slow<> and -20% armour. Every takedown within <#ffb900ff>7s<> lets her pounce again with a <#7bd96bff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#7bd96bff>40%<> shield."
      }
    }
  },
  "ko": {
    "description": {
      "league_naafiri": {
        "skill": "[확장] 단검을 던져 <#ff9028ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>25%<> 물리 피해와 <#ffb900ff>5초<> 출혈; 맞힌 챔피언에게 무리가 덤벼듦. <#ffb900ff>4초<> 안에 다음 공격은 두 번째 단검으로 <#ff9028ff>35<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>55%<>, 대상이 잃은 체력 1%당 피해 1% 증가, 챔피언 적중 시 체력 <#7bd96bff>35<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#7bd96bff>30%<> 회복.",
        "ult": "[확장] <#ff9028ff>무리의 부름<>: <#ffb900ff>0.75초<> 대상 지정 불가, 무리 두 배, 공격력 +20%, 이동 속도 +20%. 이어서 적 챔피언에게 덮쳐 <#ff9028ff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>65%<> 물리 피해, <#ef5350ff>둔화<>, 방어력 -20%. <#ffb900ff>7초<> 안에 처치 관여할 때마다 <#7bd96bff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#7bd96bff>40%<> 보호막과 함께 다시 덮침."
      }
    }
  },
  "ja": {
    "description": {
      "league_naafiri": {
        "skill": "【拡張】短剣を投げ<#ff9028ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>25%<>の物理ダメージと<#ffb900ff>5秒<>の出血、当たったチャンピオンに群れが食らいつく。<#ffb900ff>4秒<>以内の次の攻撃で二本目を投げ<#ff9028ff>35<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>55%<>、対象の失った体力1%ごとに1%増、チャンピオンなら体力<#7bd96bff>35<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#7bd96bff>30%<>回復。",
        "ult": "【拡張】<#ff9028ff>群れの呼び声<>：<#ffb900ff>0.75秒<>対象指定不可、群れが倍、攻撃力+20%、移動速度+20%。続けて敵チャンピオンに飛びかかり<#ff9028ff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>65%<>の物理ダメージ、<#ef5350ff>スロウ<>、物防-20%。<#ffb900ff>7秒<>以内のキル関与ごとに<#7bd96bff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#7bd96bff>40%<>のシールドでもう一度。"
      }
    }
  }
